1 trailing line: pack the structs below with no padding
2 trailing line: a quoted header name is a string
3 trailing block: a block comment after a macro
5 trailing block: inside the macro
6 trailing line: after the macro
9 line: A line comment in a group that is not compiled.
10-11 block: A block comment in a group that is not compiled.
16 trailing block: a block comment after a directive
19 trailing line: NEVER_DEFINED
21-23 line: a line comment that ends in a backslash continues on the next line, and the line after
